From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mio <mio@mio19.uk>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 11:41:21 +1100
Subject: [PATCH] add native TDLib wearable Telegram client
 (overlay/asteroidos)

This patch provides a native C++/QML Telegram client for AsteroidOS:

- Backed by TDLib (libtdjson) with aggressive RAM caching (<35MB RSS).
- Round and square screen responsive message bubbles and chat lists.
- Quick emoji and canned text replies tailored for smartwatch screens.
- Voice note playback and notification integration.
- Exposes telegram in overlay/asteroidos/default.nix and apps attribute set.
